	(text_box "Microcontroller-Based Function Generator\n\nOutputs: sine, triangle, square / 10 Hz to 100 kHz / 0 to + or - 5V adjustable, DC offset\nController: Raspberry Pi Pico 2 (RP2350) / Waveform: AD9833 DDS (25 MHz)\nAmplitude/offset: MCP42010 digital pot / Output: TL072, two gain stages, 51 ohm to BNC\n\nPower: 5 V USB -> Pico VBUS -> Pico 3V3 (digital) / 5 V -> DCP010512DBP -> + or -12 V (analog)\nGrounds: GND (digital) and AGND (analog) joined at one point by R11 (0 ohm) at the AD9833 header"
